; `@EXIT` (and its alias `@QUIT`) is `window.Close()`
; (GameView/EmueraConsole.cs:1357-1361) — the run ends where the command was
; entered, so the line after the INPUTS never executes. erars raises it from
; inside the input request as a marker error that TerminalVm::start turns into
; a clean exit, because no input path can return a Workflow.
@SYSTEM_TITLE
PRINTL START
INPUTS
PRINTFORML unreachable
